<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .container {
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #10b981;
      color: white;
      padding: 15px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
      margin: -20px -20px 20px;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6b7280;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .security-code {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      background-color: #fef3c7;
      border: 2px solid #f59e0b;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #10b981;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
    .info-box {
      background-color: #f3f4f6;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    .warning-box {
      background-color: #fef3c7;
      border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    .important-box {
      background-color: #dbeafe;
      border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Your Ride Has Been Scheduled!</h1>
    </div>
    
    <p>Hello <%= @passenger.first_name %>,</p>
    
    <p>Great news! A driver has claimed your ride request!</p>
    
    <div class="info-box">
      <h3>Ride Details</h3>
      <p><strong>From:</strong> <%= @ride.pickup_location %></p>
      <p><strong>To:</strong> <%= @ride.dropoff_location %></p>
      <p><strong>Scheduled Time:</strong> <%= @ride.scheduled_time.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p") %></p>
      <p><strong>Estimated Price:</strong> <%= number_to_currency(@ride.estimated_price) %></p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="info-box">
      <h3>Driver Details</h3>
      <p><strong>Name:</strong> <%= @driver.full_name %></p>
      <p><strong>Vehicle:</strong> <%= @ride.vehicle.brand %> <%= @ride.vehicle.model %></p>
      <p><strong>Color:</strong> <%= @ride.vehicle.color %></p>
      <p><strong>License Plate:</strong> <%= @ride.vehicle.registration_number %></p>
    </div>
    
    <p><strong>Be sure to be at the pickup location at the requested time.</strong></p>
    
    <div class="warning-box">
      <p><strong>🔐 Security Code</strong></p>
      <p>You will need to give the driver this code to start the drive for your safety:</p>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <div class="security-code"><%= @ride.security_code %></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="important-box">
      <p><strong>Need to make changes?</strong></p>
      <p>If you need to cancel or change your ride, please do so in RideFlow at least 1 hour before pickup. Go to your dashboard, expand the ride request "View Details" and find the cancellation button.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="info-box">
      <p><strong>💰 Payment Reminder</strong></p>
      <p>Be ready to pay for your ride when you are close to your destination. You can copy the driver's crypto address inside the ride request on RideFlow. Show the driver the completed transaction before exiting the vehicle.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="<%= @url %>/dashboard" class="button">View Ride Details</a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Thank you for choosing RideFlow for your transportation needs.</p>
      <p>© <%= Date.today.year %> RideFlow. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html> 